                "text": "You should configure your KMS keys to auto rotate to maintain security and defend against compromise.\n"
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "**Misconfiguration AVD-AWS-0065**\n| Type | Severity | Check | Message | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|Terraform Security Check|MEDIUM|A KMS key is not configured to auto-rotate.|Key does not have rotation enabled.|[AVD-AWS-0065](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/avd-aws-0065)|\n\nYou should configure your KMS keys to auto rotate to maintain security and defend against compromise.\n",
                "text": "Misconfiguration AVD-AWS-0065\nType: Terraform Security Check\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nCheck: A KMS key is not configured to auto-rotate.\nMessage: Key does not have rotation enabled.\nLink: [AVD-AWS-0065](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/avd-aws-0065)\nYou should configure your KMS keys to auto rotate to maintain security and defend against compromise.\n"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/avd-aws-0065",
              "id": "AVD-AWS-0065",
